# Task 1 review — V5 closed learning/search contracts

**Result: APPROVED**

Reviewed `2f62f3c..a4d5ecf` against `task-1-brief.md` and the Task 1 report.  The
diff is limited to the two authorized V5 files; V2–V4 are untouched.  Ruff and
`git diff --check` pass.

## Resolved finding

### [P1] Reject overlapping discovery plans at campaign-plan construction

Commit `7fbcda0` resolves the earlier P1.  A shared interval validator now runs
from `CampaignPanelPlanV5.__post_init__` before a discovery-plan digest can be
issued, and independently from `CampaignEvidenceV5.__post_init__` before
scoring.  It rejects overlapping, shared-boundary, reverse-chronological, and
ordinal-unsorted discovery input; it accepts strictly adjacent intervals (for
example, `2024-01-01..2024-01-10` followed by
`2024-01-11..2024-01-20`) under inclusive-date semantics.

Targeted direct smoke: `DISCOVERY_PLAN_INTERVAL_REVIEW_OK
adjacent=accepted rejected=overlap,shared,reverse,unsorted`.  Ruff and
`git diff --check a4d5ecf 7fbcda0` also pass.

## Verified scope

